Package: CancerRegR
Title: Exploratory Analysis of Cancer-Related Genomic Regions
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: Arefeh Saeidi, email = arefehsaiedi@gmail.com
Description: An R package for exploring cancer-related genomic regions. It includes tools to find Cpg islands, annotate regions, and summarize region data.
